Copyright (c) 2019-2021 bloc97 and contributors.

The `.glsl` shader files in `Sources/UpscaleCore/Resources/Shaders/` are vendored
unmodified from the Anime4K v4.0.1 release. Each file carries its own licence header:
the CNN and Clamp_Highlights shaders are MIT-licensed, and the AutoDownscalePre
