The preset definitions in `Sources/UpscaleCore/Shaders/Preset.swift` reproduce the
shader orderings published in Anime4K's `GLSL_Instructions.md`.


Anime4KMetal
------------
https://github.com/imxieyi/Anime4KMetal
Copyright 2021 Yi Xie.
Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

`Sources/UpscaleCore/Shaders/MSLTranslator.swift` is a port of Anime4KMetal's
`Shared/MPVShader.swift` GLSL-to-Metal translation, and keeps its approach of turning
mpv's implicit shader globals into explicit function parameters plus preprocessor
macros. The Apache-2.0 licence text is reproduced in `LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt`.


mpv
---
https://github.com/mpv-player/mpv
The user-shader directive semantics implemented in
`Sources/UpscaleCore/Shaders/MPVShaderParser.swift` and the render graph in
`Sources/UpscaleCore/Engine/` follow mpv's `video/out/gpu/user_shaders.c`.
No mpv source code is included.
